      "note": "**Safety** is a noun; after **be**, use the adjective **safe**."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "The airport has very strict safety checks for bags.",
      "correct": "The airport has very strict security checks for bags.",
      "note": "Checks against crime or attack are **security**, not **safety**."
    }
  ],
